      15px show-desktop button; 32px task icons (already compliant).

      TARGET CONTRACT  ==  element name -> behavioral hook
        OverflowToggle   : ToggleButton; opens/closes OverflowPopup (pure XAML)
        OverflowPopup    : Popup; IsOpen <-> OverflowToggle.IsChecked (TwoWay)
        OverflowIcons    : ItemsControl 3xN grid; pin overlay (moves icons)
        CustomizeLink    : TextBlock footer (visual; C# hook = reference below)
